    "Soaro is free and open source. Supporting it is optional.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro ist kostenlos und Open Source. Unterstützung ist freiwillig."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro es gratuita y de código abierto. Apoyarla es opcional."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro est gratuite et open source. La soutenir est facultatif."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro è gratuita e open source. Sostenerla è facoltativo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaroは無料のオープンソースです。応援は任意です。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro는 무료 오픈 소스입니다. 후원은 선택 사항입니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Soaro é gratuito e de código aberto. Apoiar é opcional."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro 免费且开源。是否支持完全由您决定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soaro monitors CPU, GPU, memory, disk, network and battery. It only deletes caches, logs and rebuildable folders in your home folder, or moves items to the Trash (recoverable), always after confirmation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro überwacht CPU, GPU, Arbeitsspeicher, Festplatte, Netzwerk und Batterie. Es löscht nur Caches, Protokolle und wiederherstellbare Ordner in Ihrem Benutzerordner oder legt Objekte in den Papierkorb (wiederherstellbar), immer nach Bestätigung."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro supervisa la CPU, la GPU, la memoria, el disco, la red y la batería. Solo elimina cachés, registros y carpetas regenerables de tu carpeta personal, o mueve elementos a la Papelera (recuperables), siempre tras pedir confirmación."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro surveille CPU, GPU, mémoire, disque, réseau et batterie. Il ne supprime que des caches, journaux et dossiers régénérables de votre dossier personnel, ou met à la corbeille (récupérable), toujours après confirmation."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro monitora CPU, GPU, memoria, disco, rete e batteria. Elimina solo cache, log e cartelle ricostruibili nella tua cartella Home, oppure sposta elementi nel Cestino (recuperabili), sempre dopo conferma."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro は CPU、GPU、メモリ、ディスク、ネットワーク、バッテリーを監視します。削除するのはホームフォルダ内のキャッシュ、ログ、再生成可能なフォルダのみで、そのほかはゴミ箱に入れるだけ（元に戻せます）です。いずれも必ず確認してから実行します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro는 CPU, GPU, 메모리, 디스크, 네트워크, 배터리를 모니터링해요. 홈 폴더의 캐시, 로그, 복구 가능한 폴더만 삭제하거나 항목을 휴지통으로 이동하며 (복원 가능), 항상 확인을 거쳐요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Soaro monitora CPU, GPU, memória, disco, rede e bateria. Ele só apaga caches, registros e pastas recriáveis da sua pasta pessoal, ou move itens para a Lixeira (recuperável), sempre após confirmação."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro 监控 CPU、GPU、内存、磁盘、网络和电池。它只会删除您个人文件夹中的缓存、日志和可重新生成的文件夹，或将项目移到废纸篓（可恢复），且始终会先请您确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soaro reads some macOS settings to suggest tips (battery, sleep, startup, storage, updates, backup). It never changes a setting: it opens the right System Settings pane.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro liest einige macOS-Einstellungen, um Tipps vorzuschlagen (Batterie, Ruhezustand, Start, Speicher, Updates, Backup). Es ändert nie eine Einstellung: Es öffnet den passenden Bereich der Systemeinstellungen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro lee algunos ajustes de macOS para sugerir consejos (batería, reposo, arranque, almacenamiento, actualizaciones, copia de seguridad). Nunca modifica un ajuste: abre el panel correcto de Ajustes del Sistema."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro lit certains réglages de macOS pour proposer des conseils (batterie, veille, démarrage, stockage, mises à jour, sauvegarde). Elle ne modifie jamais un réglage : elle ouvre le bon panneau de Réglages Système."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro legge alcune impostazioni di macOS per proporre consigli (batteria, stop, avvio, archiviazione, aggiornamenti, backup). Non modifica mai un'impostazione: apre il pannello giusto di Impostazioni di Sistema."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro は、ヒントを提案するために macOS の一部の設定（バッテリー、スリープ、起動、ストレージ、アップデート、バックアップ）を読み取ります。設定を変更することはなく、システム設定の該当する項目を開くだけです。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro는 팁을 제안하기 위해 일부 macOS 설정(배터리, 잠자기, 시동, 저장 공간, 업데이트, 백업)을 읽어요. 설정을 직접 변경하지는 않고, 알맞은 시스템 설정 패널을 열어줘요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Soaro lê alguns ajustes do macOS para sugerir dicas (bateria, repouso, inicialização, armazenamento, atualizações, backup). Ele nunca altera um ajuste: abre o painel certo dos Ajustes do Sistema."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro 会读取部分 macOS 设置以提供建议（电池、睡眠、启动、储存空间、更新、备份）。它绝不会更改任何设置：只会打开相应的“系统设置”面板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soaro sends no data: history stays in ~/Library/Application Support/Soaro.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro sendet keine Daten: Der Verlauf bleibt in ~/Library/Application Support/Soaro."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro no envía ningún dato: el historial permanece en ~/Library/Application Support/Soaro."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro ne transmet aucune donnée : l'historique reste dans ~/Library/Application Support/Soaro."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro non trasmette alcun dato: la cronologia resta in ~/Library/Application Support/Soaro."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro はデータを送信しません。履歴は ~/Library/Application Support/Soaro に保存されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro는 데이터를 전송하지 않아요. 기록은 ~/Library/Application Support/Soaro에 남아요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Soaro não envia nenhum dado: o histórico fica em ~/Library/Application Support/Soaro."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soaro 不发送任何数据：历史记录保存在 ~/Library/Application Support/Soaro 中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
